[0.0-1.1] spk0: Hello?
[1.6-7.2] spk1: Mrs. Higgins, this is Dr. Ross at Creekside Vet Clinic. I'm calling quickly because Barnaby is under anesthesia.
[7.7-10.5] spk0: Oh dear, is Barnaby okay? Did his teeth cleaning go wrong?
[11.0-17.4] spk1: He's stable, but while cleaning we found a cracked molar with an abscess that really needs to come out now.
[17.9-21.5] spk0: Well you have to pull it then! How much is that?
